<Layout title="about — fosskar" description="about fosskar">
  <h1>about</h1>
  <p>
    i'm a devops engineer. most of my working day goes into kubernetes:
    keeping clusters healthy, rolling out changes the gitops way so that git
    stays the single source of truth, and building the ci pipelines that get
    code there — mostly gitlab ci, with some github actions on the side.
  </p>
  <p>
    in my free time i run a homelab: i self-host my own services there, try
    out local llms, and keep the machines on nixos. when something annoys me
    often enough, it turns into a small tool; those end up on the
    <a href="/projects/">projects</a> page.
  </p>
  <p>
    this site is where the lessons land. the <a href="/wiki/">wiki</a> keeps
    short notes on what broke and how it was fixed; the
    <a href="/blog/">blog</a> is for topics that need more room.
  </p>
  <p>
    my code lives on <a href="https://github.com/fosskar">github</a>, mirrored
    to <a href="https://radicle.fosskar.eu">radicle</a>. for anything else,
    find me on <a href="https://matrix.to/#/@fosskar:fosskar.de">matrix</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
